* BookEditor Main Pillars (Constitution) 🖋️
** المحور الأول: الهوية والروح (Identity)
*** Base: TipTap Headless Engine
*** Toolbar: TinyMCE Style (Rich & Traditional)
*** Annotations: CKEditor Style (Interactive Glassmorphism)
*** Block Handles: Editor.js Style (Drag & Drop)
*** Navigation
**** Slash Menu & Markdown Shortcuts
**** Smart Keyboard Menu (Ctrl+K)
**** Smart Hierarchy Navigator (Bottom Bar)
*** Visuals
**** High-end Typography (Milkdown)
**** Deep RTL Support (Arabic Focus)
**** Floating Bubble Menu (Lexical)

** المحور الثاني: بيئة التحرير (Environment)
*** Entry: Book Index "Edit" Button
*** Workspace Modes
**** In-place Mode (Reader Context)
**** Full-Screen Mode (Dedicated Space)
**** Split View Mode (Editor + Preview)

** المحور الثالث: نطاق العمل (Scope)
*** Content Editing (Text, Headings, Footnotes)
*** Structure Management
**** Paragraph Level (Drag & Drop)
**** Hierarchy Level (Chapters & Moves)
*** Advanced Protections
**** Version History (Timeline & Undo/Redo)
**** Sync Protection (Manual vs Auto-Sync)
**** Auto-Direction (Mixed RTL/LTR)
**** Offline Persistence (LocalStorage)

** المحور الرابع: خيارات التصدير (Export)
*** PDF (Print & Official)
*** Word (.docx) (External review)
*** Markdown (.md) (Sync compatible)
*** JSON (Data structure backup)
*** Flexible Scope (Single Chapter to Full Book)

left side

** Constitution Summary
***:<b>الهوية</b>
TipTap, TinyMCE Style, CKEditor Sidebars;
***:<b>البيئة</b>
3 Workspace Modes (In-place, Full, Split);
***:<b>النطاق</b>
Deep Structure Control, History, Sync Protection;
***:<b>التصدير</b>
Multi-format (PDF, Word, MD, JSON);

